<title>JAPAN: Yamanashi Chuo Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamanashi Chuo Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    33.71		vs	   40.75</p>
<p> Operating	    7.64		vs	    8.43</p>
<p> Current		5.02		vs	    6.58</p>
<p> Net		    5.07		vs	    3.29</p>
<p> EPS		   26.40 yen	  vs	   17.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    192 million	  vs	 192 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamanashi Chuo Bank Ltd is a Yamanashi-based regional bank.</p>
